<title>Iraq: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/iraq/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-iraq-2026-10-16T18:53:13.305Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 16 Oct 2026 18:53:13 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Iraq's parliament approved the al-Zaidi cabinet while a curfew was imposed overnight in Kirkuk south of Daquq. The Iraqi bank rejected Treasury sanctions allegations and a counterfeit currency operation was uncovered near the Iran border. Militias are adjusting to a new era, and an Iraqi group publicly backed the Houthis as Saudi tensions rise. The foreign minister reiterated that Iraq does not seek war and supports paths to peace, and Morocco and Iraq signed an agreement to strengthen security training cooperation. 396 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/10/16/iraq-parliament-approves-al-zaidis-cabinet-amid-growing-economic-concerns&quot;&gt;aljazeera.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigwFBVV95cUxQY013MFZVSkd4ZVV6MGNnV1BPeWdobEpRM1JvMEhfV2JYRGxLNUZrUkVxaS1yVmpMbVo1cDVsZTJMcDN4dEZXVFAtUkh0SXFlMG5oUmowWFBpTGJ4aGZXS3pzZlJHNG16NG9jZlVJM3hSOHBMb2VDU1hzblB1MDJlbkU2UQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;شفق نيوز&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxQYWZ2VTJVTXM0a0xTTzNSTnpzcFFYd3lQSndJeFlqbEsxaDdKQlg4SlNxV09OWFhWWlNzZjAyOHNiV3U5bHVaR2NBV2JCVXl5MjQ0OWxrZk9GNk4zYVp6Vkp6S2hpdHBjZTZYcDliem45TFk2ck4zSDVMSTJNVmc5RTZzV2l0TktoR3lCN3FLVEJ2SFpjX3c?oc=5&quot;&gt;Anadolu Ajansı&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiS0FVX3lxTE94RmlFbnJMTlRMY3EtM0Fub1hXTV93REhra0VjMkhLUzRLMUJ6NmNkVWsta1VtS24wNDFPem53MEVOTzJNWGpfRHpFRQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New Region&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUEFVX3lxTE9SeHNNREpYckp0X2IxNkVMM1J5ODRRT1ZKbXFVbDVMcTVLMEVnRTdoMFV0T0gxZkc3RTZSMjduZXljazVDdFJQaC1QU1BHb1BV?oc=5&quot;&gt;باسنیوز&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxNOFNSOTB3MmI0aE5IbW1FTFFVejlSMU8zQlhrQ2ZLTFM0UmFsQ0